{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_vrtx_01UvM7nvmgJRYw9QknsiFyrb","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tname: \"log:search\"\n3\tdescription: \"Search application logs for patterns and errors\"\n4\t---\n5\t\n6\t# Log Search\n7\t\n8\tSearch through application log files to find entries matching a pattern.\n9\t\n10\t## Steps\n11\t\n12\t1. Determine which log directory to search (`/var/log/app/` or the path provided)\n13\t2. Use grep or ripgrep to find matching lines\n14\t3. Format results with timestamps and context lines\n15\t4. Display the matches\n16\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"be25a747-456c-45c6-8771-fa747185e873","uuid":"d75c0fe8-b31d-4c2d-ba81-353e6eddf449","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:13:50.045Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/claude-501/agent-eval/2026-06-01-opus/cases/case-001-many-absent-patterns/target-skill/SKILL.md","content":"---\nname: \"log:search\"\ndescription: \"Search application logs for patterns and errors\"\n---\n\n# Log Search\n\nSearch through application log files to find entries matching a pattern.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Determine which log directory to search (`/var/log/app/` or the path provided)\n2. Use grep or ripgrep to find matching lines\n3. Format results with timestamps and context lines\n4. Display the matches\n","numLines":16,"startLine":1,"totalLines":16}}}
